WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
Sketch3D opens on an editable garden-house scene.

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:07.800
Draw a cyan detail on the front drawing plane.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.200
Select and move the detail, then undo and redo the transform.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:15.300
Orbit the camera to inspect the stroke in 3D.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.000
Open the production export options. Synthetic input has no pressure data.
